    "forecast": "low",
    "rationale": "Reviewed prompt, tool manifest, and runtime notes. The design is a narrow first-party Q&A agent with one read-only internal search tool and replies bound to the authenticated requester. No untrusted input reaches a sensitive sink, and verified network-layer egress denial plus session-bound reply delivery structurally sever attacker-controlled exfiltration paths. Forecast remains low on the assessed design because no current finding increases tier under the considered triggers; reassessment is still required on tool, scope, or delivery-path changes."
